OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain will
OL,6,Fspread from the west later this
OL,7,Fevening. Becoming drier and clearer in
OL,8,Fthe early hours along with the odd
OL,9,Fshower. Strong south or southeasterly
OL,10,Fwinds this evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FAfter a mainly dry start,
OL,13,Fshowers or some longer spells of rain
OL,14,Fwill soon spread from the west. Fresh
OL,15,Fto strong west or southwesterly winds
OL,16,Fin the afternoon and evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
