OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FEarly
OL,6,Fshowers on Friday before rain spreads
OL,7,Feast for a time in the afternoon,
OL,8,Ffresh to strong southwesterly winds.
OL,9,FWindy with bright spells and showers
OL,10,Fover the weekend.
